Package: oosse
Type: Package
Title: Out-of-Sample skill scores with Standard Error Estimation
Version: 1.1.1
Authors@R: 
    c(person(given = "Stijn", family = "Hawinkel", 
    email = "stijn.hawinkel@psb.ugent.be", 
    role=c("cre", "aut"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4501-5180")))
Maintainer: Stijn Hawinkel <stijn.hawinkel@psb.ugent.be>
Description: Estimates out-of-sample skill scores through bootstrap or cross-validation as a measure of predictive performance. In addition, a standard error for this point estimate is provided, and confidence intervals are constructed.
